  <h2 id="who-we-are">Who we are and what these Terms cover</h2>
  <p>pi-rust.com is run by <a href={AUTHOR.url} rel="author">{AUTHOR.name}</a>, an individual in Westchester County, New York, United States, who maintains pi-rust. He does not run it through a company or other organization. In these Terms, “we”, “us”, and “our” mean him, and “you” and “your” mean the person who uses the services.</p>
  <p>These Terms of Service (“Terms”) govern your use of the services, which are the website at pi-rust.com and everything it runs for you and for the pi-rust app:</p>
