    <li>bug reports that the pi-rust <code>/bug</code> command uploads</li>
    <li>install telemetry, if you turn it on</li>
    <li>the model catalog that the pi-rust app downloads</li>
    <li>the <a href="/session/">session viewer</a>, which shows a session stored in a GitHub gist</li>
